// Design 180 unit 4: `sleep` takes a `Duration` and nothing else. The bare-Int
// form is GONE, with no deprecation period — a naked number carries no unit,
// and the unit it silently meant could not express a span past about 35 minutes
// (DF-170a). The diagnostic names the constructor to reach for.
// EXPECT: error
// EXPECT-ERROR-CONTAINS: `sleep` expects a `Duration`, got `Int`
// EXPECT-ERROR-CONTAINS: a span is a `Duration`: `sleep(Duration.ms(200))`

func main() {
    sleep(200)
}
